@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5398

### Get API Root
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a video frame
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/frames/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="frame.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample_frame.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Start video processing
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/videos/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoUrl": "https://storage.local/videos/sample.mp4",
  "personCharacteristics": "person wearing red shirt and blue jeans",
  "confidenceThreshold": 0.5
}

###

### Get job status
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/videos/status/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Detect person in image
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/detect/person?characteristics=person%20wearing%20red%20shirt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###